<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Refill Together — Dopamine Land NYC</title>

<style>
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  background:#0f0f14;
  color:white;
}
section {
  padding:80px 20px;
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
}
h1,h2 {
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.hero {
  text-align:center;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size:64px;
}
.hero p {
  font-size:22px;
  color:#b8b8ff;
}
.cta {
  background:#7c3aed;
  padding:15px 30px;
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:20px;
  color:white;
  text-decoration:none;
}
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px,1fr));
  gap:25px;
}
.card {
  background:#1a1a22;
  padding:20px;
  border-radius:12px;
}

/* MOCKUPS */
.mock {
  background:#18181f;
  border-radius:14px;
  overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid #2a2a35;
}

/* fake media */
.media {
  height:200px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#c084fc);
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  font-weight:bold;
}

/* IG style */
.caption {
  padding:15px;
  font-size:14px;
  color:#d4d4ff;
}

/* OOH */
.ooh {
  height:220px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:28px;
  font-weight:bold;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9333ea,#f472b6);
}

/* UGC */
.ugc {
  padding:15px;
  font-size:14px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Refill Together</h1>
  <p>The world already refilled. New York, you're next.</p>
  <a class="cta" href="#">Explore the campaign</a>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>The Opportunity</h2>
  <p>New York is full of things to do — but very few that people truly feel.</p>
  <p>Families are looking for shared experiences. Adults are looking for escape.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>The Insight</h2>
  <p><strong>Kids don’t need Dopamine Land.</strong></p>
  <p><strong>Adults do.</strong></p>
  <p>Kids just give them permission to go.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>The Idea</h2>
  <p><strong>Refill Together</strong></p>
  <p>Where kids lead the fun — and adults reconnect.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Campaign System</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">Awareness → Emotional hook</div>
    <div class="card">Consideration → Social proof</div>
    <div class="card">Conversion → Urgency & slots</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Campaign Mockups</h2>

  <div class="grid">

    <!-- IG AD -->
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="media">VIDEO: kid pulls parent into neon room</div>
      <div class="caption">
        <strong>Hook:</strong> “I brought my kid here…”<br><br>
        <strong>Turn:</strong> “…and forgot I was stressed.”<br><br>
        <strong>Caption:</strong><br>
        Kids don’t need this.<br>
        You do.<br><br>
        🎟️ Book your slot before it sells out.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- UGC -->
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="media">UGC SELFIE VIDEO</div>
      <div class="ugc">
        <strong>Script:</strong><br><br>
        “Ok I thought this was just for kids…<br>
        why am I having the best time of my life??”<br><br>
        “This is actually insane.”<br><br>
        <strong>Overlay text:</strong><br>
        I came for my kid.<br>
        I stayed for me.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- OOH -->
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="ooh">
        KIDS WILL DRAG YOU HERE.<br>
        YOU’LL THANK THEM LATER.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PERFORMANCE AD -->
    <div class="mock">
      <div class="media">FAST CUTS: rooms + laughter</div>
      <div class="caption">
        <strong>Hook:</strong> NYC is running out of fun<br><br>
        <strong>Body:</strong><br>
        Step into Dopamine Land.<br>
        Refill what the city drained.<br><br>
        <strong>CTA:</strong><br>
        Limited slots available this week
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Activation</h2>
  <p><strong>Refill Stations</strong> across NYC.</p>
  <p>Unexpected joy triggers in public spaces driving curiosity and traffic.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Measurement</h2>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <strong>CPA Target</strong><br>
      $18–$25 (family bundle weighted)
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <strong>ROAS</strong><br>
      3.5x minimum
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <strong>CTR</strong><br>
      2.5%+ (UGC expected to outperform)
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <strong>Conversion Rate</strong><br>
      4–6%
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hero">
  <h2>Dopamine Land. Now in New York.</h2>
  <a class="cta" href="https://dopaminelandexperience.com/">Get Tickets</a>
</section>

</body>
</html>
